'''Vikavolt''' (Japanese: '''クワガノン''' ''Kuwagannon'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

