==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Vikavolt|52}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*'''Disconnect''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Manectric ex|101}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

